sequenceDiagram
  participant Agent
  participant Harness
  participant Policy
  participant Approval
  participant Egress
  participant SecretStore
  participant API
  Agent->>Harness: Request API call
  Harness->>Policy: Authorize target/action
  Policy->>Approval: Ask human if sensitive
  Approval-->>Policy: Approve
  Policy->>Egress: Issue short-lived capability
  Egress->>SecretStore: Fetch/inject credential
  Egress->>API: Call service
  API-->>Egress: Response
  Egress-->>Harness: Filtered response + audit id
  Harness-->>Agent: Minimal result
